			"notes": "## Features\n- release changes and fixes ([Michael Hillcox](https://github.com/MichaelHillcox/XRay-Fabric/commit/33d38d203e9a6b1db056263c98e93ed6baff46d5))\n- keep minecraft version number in build ([Michael Hillcox](https://github.com/MichaelHillcox/XRay-Fabric/commit/6377aa520f425b22741f6abbc48f91716102ff03))\n- updated to 1.17 (stopgap) ([Michael HIllcox](https://github.com/MichaelHillcox/XRay-Fabric/commit/49e2f65cedf00dd4a73c873b615c38cd99a3a55a))\n- workflow ([Michael HIllcox](https://github.com/MichaelHillcox/XRay-Fabric/commit/8d608b98ddffaa7345337e49344dbfafafe1ba85))\n- ported to 1.18 ([Michael Hillcox](https://github.com/MichaelHillcox/XRay-Fabric/commit/6a715956f82a76d2d6fb3229ae1032b5eff91fcf))\n- updated to 1.18.2, fixed block store issues, much better performance ([Michael Hillcox](https://github.com/MichaelHillcox/XRay-Fabric/commit/1c1eb6f255073d8240f0327f18c474b4bba6b2e3))\n\n## Bug Fixes\n- error message formatting issue, buttons being unresponsive ([Michael Hillcox](https://github.com/MichaelHillcox/XRay-Fabric/commit/41b5fbb4d92dc156b04f2c7a2211f43fb1d8e0e3))\n- mapping issues, world height checking, chunkPos fixes ([Michael Hillcox](https://github.com/MichaelHillcox/XRay-Fabric/commit/27b1aa3d3d23d58264ae5880acf577dc6e3e7b89))\n- work towards new render system ([Michael Hillcox](https://github.com/MichaelHillcox/XRay-Fabric/commit/ea4623920445a7e6f289c76c57dc7ad936cbb5ec))\n\n## Commits\n- 45790f2: Merge branch '1.17-snap-update' into 1.17.x (Michael HIllcox)"
